<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-03T17:58:01.363Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:58:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant gunmen attacked a polio vaccination team in Mohmand, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, killing two policemen and wounding another. In Karachi, a PIA engineer was killed in a separate attack. Pakistani forces returned fire on Afghan Taliban posts in South Waziristan after Taliban fire on Pakistani posts, intensifying border clashes. LPG prices have surged, forcing rickshaw drivers to cut meals and increasing economic pressure on commuters. The conflict caused 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOeVBpT3lQV1E2aER5OExWUDBNcnQxVHREUm9vMjVqczdEMGFuVS1zSGxFbU9uUGdUYk1raWJCUm91cU1RV2ppRFEwbjRkVmx4RWpwTGk5TnBlbG4zbnVGTm5vbHMzR1Y1RFh2WDY1QXU4UFRpYXhpX1NESWNsM0dPQXNpZzZZR1hlaVNxQURyWWVBR05ZZmJIWUx0bnI0dHpyd1B6aU9ub3A3N0YtLWJHb1FobXhXMC1sSmFhQWxzU3NUUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1vdnAzSndLR3h1d1h1ZFNQWE01NTJKZlZWYkdLRnB0eTFWdGUxSTJoNnd3WmNLTGprMEtfc1J6S1pWRjM0TXZwOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOeTdxMC1MZndqZDFhVjBkaFJmaFBBTTR3NnhBa3p5M1VUMTNoY2Z2RUxzTTJkdmd5OWI2YW0yZlMxN2dvS0w2ejU3X19RcWtVU25YekVmaXduZDRoSUNaUTZZbkVDWDZ1MXVqUWpCcnl4NDJ4NktNZXpCN19OLVJfV1NXSE9NSmc4N3lKaTdXZ1NraWQ2cWVET3pDZW1oS18yaWw3MWpBQkpzZXVkbDNESERR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOUHFSdFVCbGVzcFY0X2IyQUdUbTVqNzZlcjVVQnBNUzJETTlSczhra1hVb3JJVVZWS2l3MXdvRE91WDU5Ui1GZUpnYzF2VVlDM0IyTnhnRFdqaWtLdG1rTkdRZkJTNDVLWUlmZzBLeWhCREhZY0tnNDFjbno1ZW5SU1F3TWUtYVZodGd6bFVhbFRDSDBfYURBYzV5NGVBWEZkWm9YZjJjNnh2Q1h0aU9Heg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNWEMzQVllYmlfU1hJZUxlUktYdnJ5T01wMnBmM245MWxGNGhTV3